Subject: Longitudinal Measurement Invariance with Binary Data: Identification Strategies
Message-ID: <gPGO9oUxx2k.TaV6pRjICAAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/lavaan/c/gPGO9oUxx2k/m/TaV6pRjICAAJ>
